{"id":"0e5e75be5dd53241","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-i-delta-0.md","title":"I-Delta-0","display":"df-i-delta-0 — I-Delta-0","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-i-delta-0","aliases":["72-df-i-delta-0"],"display":"df-i-delta-0 — I-Delta-0","depends_on":["[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic]]","[[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]]","[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]"],"source_author":"Samuel R. Buss","source_chapter":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)","source_sections":"§1.1; §1.2.1–1.2.3; §1.2.7.1","source_printed_pages":"82–84, 87","source_pdf_pages":"94–96, 99","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-i-delta-0"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-i-delta-0</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-i-delta-0 — I-Delta-0"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fb2b2dbad774692a\" href=\"?note=fb2b2dbad774692a\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e0a54fcdc8782f1\" href=\"?note=3e0a54fcdc8782f1\" title=\"72-df-bounded-induction-schemes\">72-df-bounded-induction-schemes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Samuel R. Buss"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)"},{"key":"source_sections","html":"§1.1; §1.2.1–1.2.3; §1.2.7.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"82–84, 87"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"94–96, 99"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm A}\">\\(\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm A}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm A}\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm A}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^0=\\mathcal B_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}\">\\(\\Delta_0^0=\\mathcal B_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}\\)</span> 是本语言全部有界公式（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fb2b2dbad774692a\" href=\"?note=fb2b2dbad774692a\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^0\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}\">\\(\\Delta_0^0\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3e0a54fcdc8782f1\" href=\"?note=3e0a54fcdc8782f1\" title=\"72-df-bounded-induction-schemes\">72-df-bounded-induction-schemes</a>。</li>\n<li>下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\">\\(x,y,z\\)</span> 是互异对象变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q^{\\leq}\">\\(Q^{\\leq}\\)</span> 为通常七个 Robinson 公理加上 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span> 的定义扩展。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma_Q:=\\{&amp;Sx\\ne0,\\ Sx=Sy\\to x=y,\\ x\\ne0\\to\\exists y(Sy=x),\\\\\n&amp;x+0=x,\\ x+Sy=S(x+y),\\ x\\cdot0=0,\\ x\\cdot Sy=x\\cdot y+x,\\\\\n&amp;x\\leq y\\leftrightarrow\\exists z(x+z=y)\\},\\\\\nQ^{\\leq}&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm A}(A):A\\in\\Gamma_Q\\},\\\\\n\\Delta_0^0&amp;:=\\mathcal B_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},\\\\\nI\\Delta_0&amp;:=Q^{\\leq}\\cup(\\Delta_0^0\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma_Q:=\\{&amp;Sx\\ne0,\\ Sx=Sy\\to x=y,\\ x\\ne0\\to\\exists y(Sy=x),\\\\\n&amp;x+0=x,\\ x+Sy=S(x+y),\\ x\\cdot0=0,\\ x\\cdot Sy=x\\cdot y+x,\\\\\n&amp;x\\leq y\\leftrightarrow\\exists z(x+z=y)\\},\\\\\nQ^{\\leq}&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm A}(A):A\\in\\Gamma_Q\\},\\\\\n\\Delta_0^0&amp;:=\\mathcal B_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},\\\\\nI\\Delta_0&amp;:=Q^{\\leq}\\cup(\\Delta_0^0\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ch. II 印刷 pp. 82–84、87（PDF pp. 94–96、99）。原书先给 Robinson 算术，再作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span> 的保守定义扩展；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Delta_0\">\\(I\\Delta_0\\)</span> 用有界归纳。</li>\n<li>原书印刷 p. 82 写“six axioms”，实际列出七式；本原子按七式内容记录。原有外部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 名称及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 的语言未闭合，现以本书语言明示。</li>\n<li>这保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Delta_0\">\\(I\\Delta_0\\)</span> 的原意；没有将标准模型解释当作非标准模型中的公理。其可用有界公式公理化的来源理由见印刷 p. 87。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"fb2b2dbad774692a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-induction-schemes","status":"resolved","id":"3e0a54fcdc8782f1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}$、$\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm A}$、$\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm A}$ 取 [[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"fb2b2dbad774692a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Delta_0^0=\\mathcal B_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}$ 是本语言全部有界公式（[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic]]），$\\Delta_0^0\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}$ 取 [[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-induction-schemes","status":"resolved","id":"3e0a54fcdc8782f1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Delta_0^0=\\mathcal B_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}$ 是本语言全部有界公式（[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic]]），$\\Delta_0^0\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}$ 取 [[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0^0=\\mathcal B_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0^0\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z","display":false},{"tex":"Q^{\\leq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma_Q:=\\{&Sx\\ne0,\\ Sx=Sy\\to x=y,\\ x\\ne0\\to\\exists y(Sy=x),\\\\\n&x+0=x,\\ x+Sy=S(x+y),\\ x\\cdot0=0,\\ x\\cdot Sy=x\\cdot y+x,\\\\\n&x\\leq y\\leftrightarrow\\exists z(x+z=y)\\},\\\\\nQ^{\\leq}&:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm A}(A):A\\in\\Gamma_Q\\},\\\\\n\\Delta_0^0&:=\\mathcal B_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},\\\\\nI\\Delta_0&:=Q^{\\leq}\\cup(\\Delta_0^0\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\leq","display":false},{"tex":"I\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"I\\Delta_0","display":false}],"bytes":2390,"backlinks":[{"id":"6e29245cada99db6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-190","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-i-delta-0|df-i-delta-0 — I-Delta-0]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-188","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-i-delta-0 — I-Delta-0](72-df-i-delta-0.md)"},{"id":"44d76667d32d9bbd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"基础 $Q^{\\le},I\\Delta_0$ 取 [[72-df-i-delta-0]]，归纳模式取 [[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]]，普通层级与最小数、收集模式取 [[72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection]]。$n\\in\\omega$。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-204","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-i-delta-0|df-i-delta-0 — I-Delta-0]]"},{"id":